    "updated_at": "2025-07-29T21:06:41Z",
    "body": "> This is actually getting more and more pressing by the day.\n\n@lucacasonato If you're working with a stream that includes a do-nothing element, (or you could modify your stream to filter out such elements on the readable side), [one workaround](https://github.com/James-E-A/showSaveFilePicker_polyfill/blob/5600c8573079525660986bc5c1f13bcbcacb6050/helper.html#L28-L36) pending browser implementations is to set up an interval timer in the `transformer.start` method which tries to enqueue a do-nothing element, and runs the cleanup code if that fails.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
